        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8658f637-89b1-3485-af38-3afa7afa4f5d",
                "word": "inappréciable",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2507f4c3-8ee5-4e8e-b901-bf8f6301eecc",
                        "entry_id": "8658f637-89b1-3485-af38-3afa7afa4f5d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "inappréciables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "08764dee-1798-3ae8-83af-44327bd9f499",
                        "entry_id": "8658f637-89b1-3485-af38-3afa7afa4f5d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui ne peut être apprécié, être déterminé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d387116-71c3-4dec-9e8c-e2d9693f08b3",
                                "sense_id": "08764dee-1798-3ae8-83af-44327bd9f499",
                                "text": "Ces deux objets se ressemblent tellement que la différence en est presque inappréciable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5602919e-ffd5-4b35-b665-069cb62a0ce0",
                                "sense_id": "08764dee-1798-3ae8-83af-44327bd9f499",
                                "text": "Très loin, très loin seulement, à d'inappréciables profondeurs d'horizon, on apercevait une déchirure, un jour entre le ciel et les eaux, une longue fente vide, d'une claire pâleur jaune…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa616ff9-c1c4-4c4c-bd34-0ca6c5e76ace",
                                "sense_id": "08764dee-1798-3ae8-83af-44327bd9f499",
                                "text": "Un remous la ramena à la surface, un autre l'attira violemment en bas. Cela dura un temps inappréciable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "26a8b9b8-1103-402e-871f-9b746d89f6c5",
                                "sense_id": "08764dee-1798-3ae8-83af-44327bd9f499",
                                "text": "Je me souviens de la stupeur qui avait fait suspendre pendant un temps inappréciable, mais très net, le salut de bon ton que le notaire de Vauvenargues faisait à mon père au moment où grand'mère lui dit froidement : « Mon fils ! » en le lui présentant."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e07ebc22-86ab-3bc3-92b1-f4ce68b00a0f",
                        "entry_id": "8658f637-89b1-3485-af38-3afa7afa4f5d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est d’un grand prix, de ce qu’on ne saurait trop apprécier, estimer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "407499be-a4c1-4fe4-8977-07fb61118648",
                                "sense_id": "e07ebc22-86ab-3bc3-92b1-f4ce68b00a0f",
                                "text": "Ils y furent attirés par une rade sûre, commode & qui pourroit contenir mille vaisseaux de guerre. Cet avantage inappréciable y fit jetter les fondemens de la ville de Port-Royal …."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6a1396e-ae23-417c-9a5e-23e63349bc26",
                                "sense_id": "e07ebc22-86ab-3bc3-92b1-f4ce68b00a0f",
                                "text": "Quel plaisir, saperlipopette, peut-on éprouver à jouer les tyrans, quand on a une haute situation, de la fortune, une intelligence magnifique et le don inappréciable d’y voir clair !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e809639-04d8-4c9e-9e73-ca04d85f1109",
                                "sense_id": "e07ebc22-86ab-3bc3-92b1-f4ce68b00a0f",
                                "text": "« ‬Tu es un homme ; par le fait de ta simple humanité, pour les autres, tu es encore inappréciable. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7358a2fc-85eb-4f8d-b274-b6947f14b700",
                                "sense_id": "e07ebc22-86ab-3bc3-92b1-f4ce68b00a0f",
                                "text": "« C’est un portrait du maître, et, ce qui en fait une pièce d’une valeur inappréciable, c’est qu’il est non seulement signé, mais daté de 1669, année de la mort du peintre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5f1dcb6-2d74-45c5-b514-3fce0da62b0c",
                                "sense_id": "e07ebc22-86ab-3bc3-92b1-f4ce68b00a0f",
                                "text": "Et comme il advient toujours que nous ne reconnaissons qu'après les avoir perdus, la valeur de certains avantages, rien de tel qu'un séjour en U.R.S.S. (ou en Allemagne, il va sans dire) pour nous aider à apprécier l'inappréciable liberté de pensée dont nous jouissons encore en France, et dont nous abusons parfois."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7123207b-c67e-4a64-90fc-9789eabf76a4",
                                "sense_id": "e07ebc22-86ab-3bc3-92b1-f4ce68b00a0f",
                                "text": "Dans une chambre meublée d’Aurillac, je l’affirme, aux environs de 1945, cette course aura d’inappréciables conséquences."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bf830378-42b5-46be-ab8d-f5602261faff",
                        "source_entry_id": "8658f637-89b1-3485-af38-3afa7afa4f5d",
                        "target_lang_word": "inappreciable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inappreciable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a03d731c-73fc-39ab-b9c8-6d5643e1b1f4",
                                        "entry_id": "f42e6d8b-8795-38b5-af77-f9d2117242c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "insignificant, undetectable, not able to be noticed"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e49586cc-70fb-4ce6-ba2b-13e8c32f2c3c",
                                                "sense_id": "a03d731c-73fc-39ab-b9c8-6d5643e1b1f4",
                                                "text": "...genius marks its tract, not by the observation of quantities inappreciable to any but the acutest senses, but by placing Nature in such circumstances, that she is forced to record her minutest variations on so magnified a scale, that an observer, possessing ordinary faculties, shall find them legibly written."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "166d2390-e26e-430a-9135-2e6f93901a86",
                        "source_entry_id": "8658f637-89b1-3485-af38-3afa7afa4f5d",
                        "target_lang_word": "inestimable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inestimable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "105528f7-40a4-315d-a7d8-400eaa13ef42",
                                        "entry_id": "b7507701-e639-32e2-8f1f-417bfc67a273",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not able to be estimated; not able to be calculated, computed or comprehended, as because of great scale, degree or magnitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7e353af-c0cb-4447-82bb-c911bfc91756",
                                                "sense_id": "105528f7-40a4-315d-a7d8-400eaa13ef42",
                                                "text": "The Voyager spacecraft explored the solar system and continued into the inestimable space beyond."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7679b4c8-b9bf-4628-983a-d1e750834e3d",
                                                "sense_id": "105528f7-40a4-315d-a7d8-400eaa13ef42",
                                                "text": "He has refused to pass other Laws for the accommodation of large districts of people, unless those people would relinquish the right of Representation in the Legislature, a right inestimable to them and formidable to tyrants only."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c202fec-bbd0-37bb-bc7a-8150da7fca5f",
                                        "entry_id": "b7507701-e639-32e2-8f1f-417bfc67a273",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Venerable, great."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c972a205-7547-4e11-b631-bdf1248ce580",
                                                "sense_id": "5c202fec-bbd0-37bb-bc7a-8150da7fca5f",
                                                "text": "On my arrival hither I found a letter from the inestimable Mr. Wythe, by which he informs me that in consequence of a late act of our general assembly he remains the sole judge of the high court of chancery."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "06ff9084-8708-411f-bd0e-e5ef02bdbe19",
                        "source_entry_id": "8658f637-89b1-3485-af38-3afa7afa4f5d",
                        "target_lang_word": "invaluable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "invaluable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c28e519a-3d5f-3ff3-a04a-62881e350c06",
                                        "entry_id": "70c6acce-ec04-3404-a0f4-a660f3190885",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having great or incalculable value."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6e73d14-ad1f-400a-a600-c6008e071cee",
                                                "sense_id": "c28e519a-3d5f-3ff3-a04a-62881e350c06",
                                                "text": "You are a very strange creature by way of a friend!—always wanting me to play and sing before anybody and everybody! If my vanity had taken a musical turn, you would have been invaluable; but as it is, I would really rather not sit down before those who must be in the habit of hearing the very best performers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95591788-c67b-40a2-84e8-e731f1a07548",
                                                "sense_id": "c28e519a-3d5f-3ff3-a04a-62881e350c06",
                                                "text": "Colonel Cathcart bewailed the miserable fate that had given him for an invaluable assistant someone as common as Colonel Korn. It was degrading to have to depend so thoroughly on a person who had been educated at a state university."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec5e1640-87a3-3480-ae9b-d3825962c635",
                                        "entry_id": "70c6acce-ec04-3404-a0f4-a660f3190885",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not valuable; valueless; worthless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f0f7836-fdbc-4da4-ada6-374eac015e69",
                                                "sense_id": "ec5e1640-87a3-3480-ae9b-d3825962c635",
                                                "text": "The money I have received is so invaluable a sum that I have forborne as yet to pay it in, and am heartily sorry that I cannot better advance His Majesty's service."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c900daa0-08ed-437b-9826-5e1ca7b50b82",
                                                "sense_id": "ec5e1640-87a3-3480-ae9b-d3825962c635",
                                                "text": "It would be an interesting, and far from an invaluable labour, to trace the history of the murrains, or cattle diseases of former days, and there causes and effects."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aea749bb-9839-4474-96db-9c6e13882f87",
